function recentMealProgressState(text){const t=String(text||'').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();if(!t||/(?:不吃|不想吃|不准备吃|还没吃|没有吃|没吃|别问.{0,4}吃)/.test(t)||/(?:你|他|她|角色).{0,6}(?:吃饭|吃早饭|吃早餐|吃午饭|吃晚饭|吃东西)/.test(t))return'';if(/(?:吃完|吃好)(?:饭|早饭|早餐|午饭|晚饭)?(?:了|啦)?|(?:已经|刚刚|刚才|刚|才).{0,5}(?:吃了|吃过)(?:饭|早饭|早餐|午饭|晚饭)?/.test(t))return'finished';if(/(?:^|[，。！？,.!?\s])(?:我)?(?:先|现在|马上|这就|准备|打算|要|得|该|去|正在|开始).{0,5}(?:吃饭|吃早饭|吃早餐|吃午饭|吃晚饭|吃东西)|(?:我)?(?:吃饭|吃早饭|吃早餐|吃午饭|吃晚饭)去了|(?:我)?吃饭了(?:呀|啊|啦)?(?:$|[，。！？,.!?\s])/.test(t))return'started';return'';}
function recentMealBaselineQuestion(text){return/(?:吃|用)(?:饭|早饭|早餐|午饭|晚饭)(?:了)?(?:吗|没|没有)|(?:吃了没|吃过了吗|有没有吃(?:饭|早饭|早餐|午饭|晚饭)?)|(?:面|面条|粥|东西)(?:吃|喝)(?:了)?(?:吗|没|没有)/.test(String(text||'').replace(/\s+/g,''));}
function recentMealProgress(c,now){now=+now||Date.now();const rows=roleInteractionRows(c).filter(x=>x&&x.at<=now&&now-x.at<=4*3600000);let user=null,state='';for(let i=rows.length-1;i>=0;i--){if(rows[i].role!=='user')continue;const found=recentMealProgressState(rows[i].text);if(found){user=rows[i];state=found;break;}}if(!user)return null;const asked=rows.some(x=>x.role==='assistant'&&x.at>=user.at-2*3600000&&x.at<=now&&recentMealBaselineQuestion(x.text));return{state,at:user.at,text:user.text.slice(0,120),asked};}
function recentMealProgressPrompt(c,now){const row=recentMealProgress(c,now);if(!row)return'';const when=fmtDT(row.at),known=row.state==='finished'?'已经明确吃完或吃好了':'已经明确准备去吃、正在吃或刚开始吃';return'[最近关心事项进度｜真实聊天事实]\n'+when+'，用户'+known+'，原话是「'+row.text+'」。'+(row.asked?'你此前已经问过是否吃饭，并得到了这条进度；':'你已经得到这条吃饭进度；')+'这不要求你主动谈吃饭；但如果现在自然关心，只能承接进度，例如问吃好了吗、吃得怎么样或吃了什么，不能退回去再问“吃饭了吗/吃饭没有”。如果用户已说吃完，也不能再问吃好没有。';}
function recentMealProgressIssue(c,text,now){const row=recentMealProgress(c,now);if(!row)return'';const t=String(text||'').replace(/\s+/g,''),baseline=recentMealBaselineQuestion(t),finishedFollowup=/(?:吃好|吃完)(?:了)?(?:吗|没|没有)|(?:面|面条|粥)(?:吃|喝)(?:好|完)(?:了)?(?:吗|没|没有)/.test(t);if(row.state==='finished'&&(baseline||finishedFollowup))return'用户已经明确吃完，回复却退回去询问是否吃或是否吃完';if(row.state==='started'&&baseline)return'用户已经明确开始吃，回复却退回去询问是否吃饭';return'';}
